 ;; ── decision ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 :decision
 {:name "kotoba-genome — one shared inheritable organism substrate; every actor born self-keyed, self-evolving, multi-channel, dialogic; keyless observational mirror retired."
  :boundary "first-party disclosure model (founder 2026-06-30): former mirrors become self-keyed growing posting actors that post AS 'etzhayyim's <domain> observatory actor', NEVER impersonating the real entity; private persons consent-gated/excluded; seed-and-grow safety rails inherited; un-amendable catastrophe term preserved (it is what makes 'everything posts' safe)."
  :D1 "Unify: resident loop = outer durable loop (lease/tick/budget/governor/crash-recovery) drives the inner active-inference+co-scientist learning loop (generalized out of ibuki); reflex -> _prior_consensus -> next-tick decision; 生命進化 becomes a closed loop whose generating function changes (bounded, governed). Self-mod stays proposal-only, human/Council-gated."
  :D2 "kotoba-lang Channel egress protocol: defprotocol Channel + registry mapping lexicon-prefix -> driver; channel-neutral emit envelope; fan-out drainer; drivers at-proto (refactor existing) + email (re-register openmail) + x/telegram/line/sms-phone as driver additions; identity = did:key CACAO leash (channel-agnostic, already DKIM-reused); content-scan + no-person-targeting before emit, channel-independent."
  :D3 "kotoba-lang shared behavior library: identity/social/evolution/dialog/gate-kit implemented once and inherited; actor declares what, inherits how; requires populating 40-engine/kotoba + implement-or-retire kotodama-evolver; until then wrap the clj path (langgraph-clj + generalized ibuki loop) as reference runtime."
  :D4 "Retire keyless mirror (amend ADR-2606042330 D3/D4/G1/G5): every entity-actor first-party with own present-only member-leashed did:key + self-evolution (D1/D3) + autonomous posting+dialog (D2 + convo/A2A). Non-impersonation = DISCLOSURE duty not keyless impossibility: posts/speaks AS etzhayyim's <domain> observatory (voiceOf=etzhayyim, isObservatory=true on handle/profile/every post); never claims to BE the real entity; private persons excluded/consent-gated (former G3 retained, anchored to catastrophe term + §2(g)). mirrorPost/personSubject-unrepresentable -> observatoryPost{voiceOf,isObservatory} + personSubject consent-cap default-closed."
  :D5 "Domain (com-x) actors first-class: declare identity/manifest+cells(D3)+lexicons(own+shared convo/A2A)+registry; inherit self-key(D4)+Channel emit(D2)+learning(D1/D3)+dialog; -> evolving, posting, conversable API by construction."
  :D6-waves {:W0 "this ADR + Charter v3.6 (design + constitutional pivot; NO live posting AS any real entity)."
             :W1 "Channel protocol (D2): defprotocol+registry+at-proto+email re-registered+channel-neutral envelope+content-scan hook; Telegram PoC driver dry-run."
             :W2 "Unify loop (D1): reflex->_prior_consensus->next-tick; generalize ibuki AI+co-scientist into shared lib."
             :W3 "Shared behavior lib (D3): populate 40-engine/kotoba; implement-or-retire kotodama-evolver; move identity/social/evolution/dialog/gate-kit into kotoba-lang; migrate first actor cohort."
             :W4 "Entity pivot (D4/D5): regenerate namespace registries keyless->first-party disclosure; turn up dialog+autonomous posting under seed-and-grow gate, R0 dry-run -> Council-gated live."}}

